{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S05等短停留段的感受词有些密集，部分近义意象连续出现，瞬时扫读不如X的左右分区利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段最重要的情绪和心理变化凸显出来，普通观众即使没有读过原文，也比较容易抓住人物当下的处境和动机。它的感受词不仅描述情绪，还能跟随音乐的具体变化逐步出现，使从试探、放松、患得患失到坦然接受的过程更有层次，前后也更像同一个人的连续心理经历。X的左右分区确实更容易快速浏览，但部分长句承载的信息较多，感受词也相对概括，音乐变化与细腻心理之间的对应没有Y那么充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e1341280-a593-4f0d-9155-093dfbf44503", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T010317481925Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:05:06.740043+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "38b3e7b55b5b3d051c41417ee40b8c7c4b4f01cc94a87cb646f133bfce7dec6a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web